!Unsupervised-Journey-Clustering/scripts/
!Unsupervised-Journey-Clustering/scripts/**
!Unsupervised-Journey-Clustering/taxonomy/
!Unsupervised-Journey-Clustering/taxonomy/**
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
